== Reward ==

<ul><li>Minor coin</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

Llscent Tagglefoot by the druids guild is in a bind.  He will say he needs somone to deliver a [[Case of Jumjum Juice]] to Xanuusus a treant in the Northern Karanas Plains.

Say "I will take the Jumjum Juice" and you will be provided with a case.

Getting to Treant is a long walk.  Go to North Karana and follow the water to the right.  When you hit the mountains follow them and you will run right into him.  I have been told you no longer have to levitate to give him the jum jum juice.

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction with [[Storm Reapers]] has gotten better.
* Your faction with [[Mayor Gubbin]] has gotten better.
* Your faction with [[Merchants of Rivervale]] has gotten better.
* Your faction with [[Unkempt Druids]] has gotten worse.
</div>

You will also get some minor coin and a minor item.

